"P345779657" "{PERSON_NAME} conversation"
// DetailString :
"P1714046240" "When you rescued {PERSON_NAME}, he said:<br><br>'It was most extraordinary! We had found what looked to be some sort of earlier excavation. It was incredible. The huge caverns! The most amazing rock formations! There was a strange stone that looked as though it were some sort of petrified ice. We'd just located some sort of man-made stone work, when we were suddenly surrounded by those robed figures! It's a good thing you came along when you did!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2041184566" "{PERSON_NAME} from Paragon University recently took an advanced class of geology students spelunking in the caves under the city. It's kind of a tradition for him, but this was the first time he's taken a class down since the Rikti War. According to the dean, that class hasn't yet reported back. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Somebody's got to find that missing class.</A> You only have 75 minutes to find the students."
// AcceptString :
"P396180293" "Find the missing class"
// SendOffString :
"P3137355613" "I'm worried about this class, {HeroName}. They were supposed to be back hours ago."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P194346827" "Defeat lead mystic, his coven"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2387250249" "You must find {PERSON_NAME} and his students."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2649466741" "A few sack lunches and a muddy textbook are the only signs that the missing students were ever here."

