// Task - SL4_CoT_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1427125580" "The mysterious mystics of the Circle of Thorns have been appearing in greater numbers lately. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to hit the streets and defeat a few Circle of Thorns mystics in order to ensure the citizens' safety.</A> I understand that numbers of them have been spotted in Talos Island, but I'm sure any zone in the city would welcome your help."
// AcceptString :
"P1944327305" "Hit the streets and defeat a few Circle of Thorns mystics"
// SendOffString :
"P1752899315" "You'd best keep your wits about you, {HeroName}. The Circle's mystics are dangerous foes."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2132417412" "Combat Circle of Thorns menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P163916716" "The battle ahead may be long, but I have every confidence in you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4286808955" "You have discouraged the Circle of Thorns from threatening the citizens' safety."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P176610374" "You have done very well, {HeroName}. The Circle is sure to know you're watching their every move."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_CoT_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P899650443" "I've heard from friends all around Talos Island that the Circle of Thorns have been seen in greater numbers there recently. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>They've asked me to speak with heroes such as yourself to see if any are willing to combat the Circle of Thorns in Talos Island.</a> From what they tell me, New Troy and Ithaca Island have seen a large increase in the Circle's numbers, but any part of the zone would welcome your presence."
// AcceptString :
"P2552902382" "Combat the Circle of Thorns in Talos Island"
// SendOffString :
"P4181075513" "The people of Talos Island are worried, {HeroName}. Hopefully your presence should calm them greatly."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1831372616" "Defeat Circle in Talos Island"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1486084554" "I need you to get back to Talos Island and defeat some more Circle of Thorns mystics."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P789340611" "You have ensured the safety of Talos Island."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P291415495" "The Circle of Thorns is always trying to plot against the people of Paragon City. It is fortunate that we are blessed by vigilant guardians such as you, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_CoT_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P950573590" "The Circle's activities in Talos Island have grown more brazen and outrageous lately, and everyone is starting to fear for their lives. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to curtail some of their rituals in Talos Island.</A> Circe Island and Eleusis are particularly overrun, but I'm sure you can find places all over the zone to take a stand against them."
// AcceptString :
"P1026302212" "Curtail Circle rituals in Talos Island"
// SendOffString :
"P3601691940" "Good luck to you in this battle, {HeroName}. The city's hopes go with you."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3940927628" "I know that you can defeat the Circle's crazed mystics and diabolical creatures, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4259700423" "You have curtailed the Circle's activities in Talos Island."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P539138286" "You've dealt a great blow to the Circle of Thorns' plans, {HeroName}. You have my thanks, and the city's thanks."
